# maluos-desktop: the MaluOS workstation. GNOME 50 with Ubuntu's session
# extensions and the Yaru look, no snaps (so GNOME Web, not Firefox),
# and no Ubuntu-branded update or reporting tools. Pair it with
# maluos-server (image/profiles/desktop.pkgs does) for a local memory host.
maluos-base
maluos-desktop-branding
